 Universities 4\",\"year\":2026,\"rating\":5.4}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":23202,\"title\":\"Trick 'r Treat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w0nmol4g7n6MFfhfphV7GzHHYjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7rPwe5T63MT9GfOct0be50pYdAL.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four interwoven stories that occur on Halloween: an everyday high school principal has a secret life as a serial killer; a college virgin might have just met the one guy for her; a group of teenagers pull a mean prank, and a bitter old recluse receives an uninvited guest.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":323262,\"title\":\"Holidays\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5FXtPtetZaB0giJEqC6mOLBr15A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j0WqwIfrrzDgvnEBXbzM41ulpWY.jpg\",\"rating\":4.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An anthology feature film that puts a uniquely dark and original spin on some of the most iconic and beloved holidays of all time by challenging our folklore, traditions and assumptions.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16304,\"title\":\"Creepshow 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qvJSdbruD4e5cUxruoUFUkJrsqt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/plKlKfXuWB0O7s3RF2oKVAreJYS.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This follow-up to the George Romero/Stephen King-launched anthology series features five new tales of horror and a wraparound. The main stories deal with alternative realities (\\\"Alice\\\"), possessed communication devices (\\\"The Radio\\\"), vampires and serial killers in lust (\\\"Call Girl\\\"), mad inventors (\\\"The Professor's Wife\\\"), and hauntings from beyond the grave (\\\"Haunted Dog\\\").\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":636891,\"title\":\"Scare Package\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gRf46QmAsSKoHPKNTnCdyPIo1bG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/60w5MmaN69s3FAkKTkbz60EKjQk.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chad Buckley is super crazy about horror movies, but also very lonely. He mostly spends his days in his small movie shop having wild discussions with his only returning customer, Sam.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":479867,\"title\":\"Nightwalkers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r1p1jeSeNQ2ZVud5yL1ik6vnaKw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nightwalkers is three tales of revenge from the grave as told by the town historian. \\\"The Initiation\\\" involves a fraternity prank gone wrong as three friends accidentally kill someone and face a vengeful zombie. \\\"The Family Friend\\\" finds three drug smuggling punks taking a wrong turn and ending up in a farming community haunted by a killer scarecrow. Finally, in \\\"Nia: Undying Love\\\" a scorned woman gets revenge on her ex-boyfriend from beyond the grave.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1259365,\"title\":\"The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar and Three More\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gBOtLTs0GNMEZnisAK132o5V67.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9MVdbQVNZA92fh4klywkNPbBeKC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four tales unfold in Wes Anderson's anthology of short films adapted from Roald Dahl's beloved stories, \\\"The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar\\\", \\\"The Swan\\\", \\\"The Rat Catcher\\\", and \\\"Poison.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1064450,\"title\":\"Alkhallat+\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/znOml3I0JoZaYL47B7u7WuNzKHI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qTU2mExebq379PS8P5Qrm4ToVyY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"He who has a trick in their bag, they shall use it. An anthology of social deception and trickery in four unlikely places.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":861264,\"title\":\"Triaphilia\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kV2AHopNG3MpCETgznWQGSqHF10.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oZKvLQjFvNSrjJtsIKTGLewN9SM.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Triaphilia- A fear that terrible things come in 3's. In a small store filled with antiques and curiosities called The Anointed Cherub, a charming proprietor convinces customers to purchase the items he feels are perfect for them...however, what they don't know is that each item comes with a horrible consequence. Triaphilia tells the story of 3 items that destroy the lives of the people that purchase them.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":480100,\"title\":\"Nightmare Cinema\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ftdhL4zamDnjSD4TML1ES79DueX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ow1CdUbmZPMKqDj2bow98A2cwCT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A series of down-on-their-luck individuals enter the decrepit and spine-chilling Rialto theater, only to have their deepest and darkest fears brought to life on the silver screen by The Projectionist – a mysterious, ghostly figure who holds the nightmarish futures of all who attend his screenings.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1066376,\"title\":\"Night of the Missing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/84UYnXhDR9dkxW4TFshOWeLq16U.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bDtXzxS0XUcq6yT0NxvbX63RH2a.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set on a stormy night on Christmas Eve, a small town female sheriff who secretly is a serial killer gets a visit from a mysterious woman who tells four bizarre stories.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476869,\"title\":\"Strange Events\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJTGCfvs9YgwFkFWBvTwEk4QomD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oYSm0fSX6Cto25n5CiqRjlYQijt.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a world where monsters, ghosts and other dreadful creatures are a reality, nightmares can come true. And they will. An anthology that delves into the paranormal, the bizarre and the downright insane. No place is safe.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":478974,\"title\":\"Tales from the Grave, Volume 2: Happy Holidays\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2wSPXWGuv2U9f9TD8QH6saR5NyD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Come join the Old Crone one more time in this chilling sequel! This time around, the Crone takes you on a year's holiday journey. Watch what happens when Valentine's Day becomes a blood bath. The luck of the Irish will be the only thing that will save you on St. Patrick's Day. Be careful of the curse of the mummy on Halloween night. On Thanksgiving, a turkey never tasted so good as Stanley does. And on Christmas, find out how Dorothy finally gets her angel. Come gaze one more time in the crystal ball and see how the \\\"Holidays\\\" can be so fun!\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"3BETYCL46Mg\",\"name\":\"เทอม 3 - ตัวอย่างเต็ม (Official Trailer : ซับอังกฤษ)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}